    {
      "platform": "tiktok",
      "id": "7685463908596911378",
      "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@lifeofseif/video/7685463908596911378",
      "caption": "I was so incredibly happy to find these photos. A while back, I watched a Jschlatt video, he featured a lot of old childhood footage of him and his brother getting their first consoles. These clips just captured the magic of that era so perfectly. It honestly made me a bit sad, wondering if I had any real documentation of those kinds of moments I hold so close to me, or if they were just bound to become fading memories; maybe they still are anyways.. But finding these brought me so much relief, and a whole new level of appreciation for my Dad. I already cherished this memory just because he took the time out of his day to bring me to something I was really excited about; A silly promo event for a console that ended up being the biggest joke of the century (I still love mine, modded to perfection 🤌). But looking back at these, I realized he wasn't just standing there waiting for it to be over, he was really seeing me, and taking the time to hold on to that moment for the both of us. I love my Dad, hes the best. #nostalgia #wiiu #nintendo #memories #toronto ",
      "title": "I was so incredibly happy to find these photos. A while back, I…",
